{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Wire Removal with Clean Plates.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Wire Removal with Clean Plates.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"wire removal with clean plates wire removal with clean plates","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Wire Removal with Clean Plates.md","fileName":"Wire Removal with Clean Plates.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Wire Removal with Clean Plates","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 18:17\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Matte Painting and Scene Finishing]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Matte Painting and Scene Finishing","Difference Keying with a Clean Plate","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Wire Removal with Clean Plates.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Wire Removal with Clean Plates.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"wire removal with clean plates wire removal with clean plates","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Wire Removal with Clean Plates.md","fileName":"Wire Removal with Clean Plates.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Wire Removal with Clean Plates","heading":"Wire Removal with Clean Plates","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"To remove a visible support rig, roto its changing footprint as a window and reveal a matched clean plate behind it. The clean plate must be tracked or animated with the original shot, and the roto edge feathered enough to hide a seam. The book's bungee example also repairs harness marks on the performer with cloning, copied and warped body material, and a small amount of restored motion blur. One replacement plate cannot solve every occlusion; some areas require independent paint or reconstruction. See [[Difference Keying with a Clean Plate]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Matte Painting and Scene Finishing","Difference Keying with a Clean Plate","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Wire Removal with Clean Plates.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Wire Removal with Clean Plates.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"wire removal with clean plates wire removal with clean plates","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Wire Removal with Clean Plates.md","fileName":"Wire Removal with Clean Plates.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Wire Removal with Clean Plates","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Matte Painting and Scene Finishing","Difference Keying with a Clean Plate","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}